      <section class="section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="eyebrow">Guides</div>
          <h2 class="section-title">The thinking behind the numbers</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="popular-row">
          <div class="popular-card">
            <div class="popular-label">Savings</div>
            <h3>How Much Emergency Savings Should I Have?</h3>
            <p>What a real cushion looks like before a wedding, baby, or bad month.</p>
            <a class="popular-link" href="/how-much-emergency-savings-should-i-have">Read Guide &rarr;</a>
          </div>

          <div class="popular-card">
            <div class="popular-label">Debt</div>
            <h3>How Much Debt Is Too Much?</h3>
            <p>Debt-to-income, monthly obligations, and where things start to feel tight.</p>
            <a class="popular-link" href="/how-much-debt-is-too-much">Read Guide &rarr;</a>
          </div>

          <div class="popular-card">
            <div class="popular-label">Cars</div>
            <h3>How Much Car Can I Afford?</h3>
            <p>A realistic number that accounts for insurance, depreciation, and total ownership cost.</p>
            <a class="popular-link" href="/how-much-car-can-i-afford">Read Guide &rarr;</a>
